{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1002_p", "source_sha256": "025aca3261e543f0aa02459ba6182ef81b1958b3f4dc6d5dd1e7d9d0927ebef0", "ja": "莉緒、ちょうどよかった……って、\nずるいって何のことだ？", "zh": "莉绪，你来得正好……\n呃，你说狡猾是指什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
