{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "c8294d34657eeafaf9b96bcacdfa9eff53d6bf4d8f3c0378290ae3420b908882", "ja": "女の子がこんなにも素敵な衣装をもらって、\nドキドキしないわけないじゃない！", "zh": "女孩子拿到这么棒的服装，\n怎么可能不怦然心动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "9de268a21b7e233dc181ccdae27d8bd52506c4bdf01bd6ffe07c13fb9a9865a1", "ja": "男の子をドキドキさせるのは、アイドルの私の役目よ？\nなのに……もう、本当にずるいんだから。", "zh": "让男孩子怦然心动，这可是我身为偶像的职责喔？\n然而你却……唉，你真的很狡猾。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e785f40350c0390b04b8a8e11aa2c80631f8597a398b629e70a88292413ec22d", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことか……。\nじゃあ、褒められたと思っておくよ。", "zh": "原来如此，你是这个意思啊……\n那我就当作是被称赞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1007_p", "source_sha256": "00fb0362fcea55712fb68c49b9db682d30c3817cfee8cfbace631129790d7d59", "ja": "ブログの反響も大きいし……\n莉緒が気にいってるなら良かった。", "zh": "在部落格上也有获得很大的回响……\n你喜欢就再好不过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1008_046rio", "source_sha256": "e50c2fcb88db7708a9b2c13e2888d50f3fc4f23e53e198d441af642e91ebad3e", "ja": "ええ、すごく気に入ってるのよ？　この衣装。\n何と言っても、私の魅力を引き立ててくれるし。", "zh": "嗯，我很喜欢这套服装啊！\n最关键的是，它能衬托出我的魅力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1009_046rio", "source_sha256": "6edcf61864c8127c638de3995d8ea4a3d5e697521183defe39f2de940c74d65f", "ja": "こんな衣装がもらえるなんて思ってもみなかったわ。\n{$P$}くん、ホントにやるわね……。", "zh": "我真没想到能拿到这么棒的服装。\n{$P$}，你真的很能干……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1010_046rio", "source_sha256": "de50ebba6b3a5ca9cd2d7e0afb0a856a131db99d7f60fdf8a0dad0e7b970596c", "ja": "こんなに私のことを理解してくれてるなんて……\nキミがプロデューサーでよかったって改めて思ったわ。", "zh": "你居然这么了解我……\n让我重新体认到有你来当制作人真是太好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1011_p", "source_sha256": "26168ba5d61fe4c83ffe8fc1e457d3348cbc37cb934985fac7c197921b072428", "ja": "なんだか、そんなに褒められると\n後が怖いような……。", "zh": "总觉得被这么大力夸奖，\n之后会很可怕……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1012_046rio", "source_sha256": "ce788271648c824383f08dd299581776c5d891172f932580266dc325e76b8209", "ja": "フフ、そうね。……ね、{$P$}くん？\n今日の帰り、もちろん付き合ってくれるでしょ？", "zh": "呵呵，是啊……欸，我说{$P$}，\n今天工作结束后，你当然也会陪我吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1013_046rio", "source_sha256": "3aeea0d9a0957106a4c2d4b11630765be322df7b2398653dc9321afc452089b5", "ja": "今日は{$P$}くんが「参った」って\n言うまで、思いっきりドキドキさせちゃうんだから。", "zh": "今天直到{$P$}说「投降」为止，\n我都要让你心动到不行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1014_p", "source_sha256": "91e84f38486449e04ff598864fdc5b54e6eca64f3b48d2118118c77acc0b61ee", "ja": "付き合うのは構わないけど……\nどうしてそんな話になるんだ？", "zh": "要我奉陪是无所谓啦……\n但话题怎么会转到这边来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1015_046rio", "source_sha256": "de38be8b81d0b471562a0525380ac0a8ad4656371a22e2caabdd6c32ba58085c", "ja": "もう、さっきから言ってるでしょ！\n私はドキドキさせられるより、ドキドキさせたいの！", "zh": "真是的，我从刚才不就一直在说吗！\n比起对人心动，我更想让人心动！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_046rio0064_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_046rio0064_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "aa169aa5b956f1fe4ecd5aee721b7ba8c69baa9a7e508577bbfc5e4a8fccff90", "ja": "わかったら……覚悟してね？　フフッ♪", "zh": "你懂了的话……就做好觉悟吧，呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
